#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:4
msgid "v3.6.5"
msgstr "v3.6.5"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:6
msgid ""
"v3.6.5 updates TensorFlow and :mod:`ulab`, substantially improves the "
"**HM01B0** camera (arbitrary resolutions, QQVGA, cropping, "
"``set_auto_exposure()``, and an anti-flicker fix), and brings Portenta "
"external-SDRAM and production board support. The legacy CMSIS-NN training "
"tooling/examples were removed and the OpenMV 4 Plus framebuffer was reduced "
"— read the breaking changes below."
msgstr ""
"v3.6.5 werkt TensorFlow en :mod:`ulab` bij, verbetert de **HM01B0** camera "
"aanzienlijk (willekeurige resoluties, QQVGA, croppen, "
"``set_auto_exposure()``\\ , en een anti-flikker-fix), en brengt "
"ondersteuning voor Portenta externe-SDRAM en productieboards. De verouderde "
"CMSIS-NN trainingstooling/voorbeelden zijn verwijderd en de framebuffer van "
"de OpenMV 4 Plus is verkleind — lees de breaking changes hieronder."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:15
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Op deze pagina"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:18
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Hoogtepunten"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:20
msgid ""
"**HM01B0** — arbitrary resolutions, QQVGA, cropping, and "
"``set_auto_exposure()`` support, plus an automatic-exposure flicker fix."
msgstr ""
"**HM01B0** — ondersteuning voor willekeurige resoluties, QQVGA, croppen en "
"``set_auto_exposure()``\\ , plus een fix voor flikkering bij automatische "
"belichting."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:22
msgid "**TensorFlow / ulab** updated to their latest versions."
msgstr "**TensorFlow / ulab** bijgewerkt naar hun nieuwste versies."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:23
msgid "**Portenta** — external-SDRAM usage and production board files."
msgstr "**Portenta** — gebruik van externe SDRAM en productieboardbestanden."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:24
msgid ""
"**Fixes** — lens correction, image quality at low resolutions, and an FPS "
"clock fix."
msgstr ""
"**Fixes** — lenscorrectie, beeldkwaliteit bij lage resoluties, en een FPS-"
"klokfix."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:26
msgid ""
"**Breaking:** the legacy CMSIS-NN training/conversion tooling and examples "
"were removed and the OpenMV 4 Plus framebuffer was reduced — see the "
"breaking changes."
msgstr ""
"**Breaking:** de verouderde CMSIS-NN trainings-/conversietooling en "
"voorbeelden zijn verwijderd en de framebuffer van de OpenMV 4 Plus is "
"verkleind — zie de breaking changes."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:31
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Nieuwe functies"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:33
msgid ""
"**HM01B0** — added arbitrary-resolution support, QQVGA and additional stubs,"
" sensor-side cropping, and :func:`sensor.set_auto_exposure` support."
msgstr ""
"**HM01B0** — ondersteuning voor willekeurige resoluties toegevoegd, QQVGA en"
" extra stubs, croppen aan de sensorzijde, en ondersteuning voor "
":func:`sensor.set_auto_exposure`\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:35
msgid ""
"**Apriltag readout** — added a readout-control apriltag-tracking example."
msgstr ""
"**Apriltag-readout** — een readout-gestuurd apriltag-trackingvoorbeeld "
"toegevoegd."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:38
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Overige wijzigingen en verbeteringen"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:40
msgid ""
"Updated TensorFlow and :mod:`ulab` to their latest versions; added Portenta "
"external-SDRAM usage and production/CI board files; cleaned up the MT9V034 "
"driver and the framebuffer accessor functions."
msgstr ""
"TensorFlow en :mod:`ulab` bijgewerkt naar hun nieuwste versies; gebruik van "
"Portenta externe-SDRAM en productie-/CI-boardbestanden toegevoegd; de "
"MT9V034-driver en de framebuffer-accessor-functies opgeschoond."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:45
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Bugfixes"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:47
msgid "Camera and imaging:"
msgstr "Camera en beeldverwerking:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:49
msgid ""
"Fixed flickering during automatic exposure on the HM01B0, lens correction, "
"image quality at lower resolutions, the OV5640/JPEG line copy (``dest_fb``),"
" the FPS clock, and returning 0 when ``bpp`` is negative; removed an "
"unnecessary HM01B0 horizontal flip."
msgstr ""
"Flikkering tijdens automatische belichting op de HM01B0 gerepareerd, "
"lenscorrectie, beeldkwaliteit bij lagere resoluties, de OV5640/JPEG-"
"regelkopie (\\ ``dest_fb``\\ ), de FPS-klok, en het teruggeven van 0 wanneer"
" ``bpp`` negatief is; een onnodige horizontale spiegeling van de HM01B0 "
"verwijderd."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:55
msgid "Hardware and board support"
msgstr "Hardware- en board-ondersteuning"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:57
msgid "**HM01B0** — arbitrary resolutions, QQVGA, and cropping."
msgstr "**HM01B0** — willekeurige resoluties, QQVGA en croppen."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:58
msgid ""
"**Arduino Portenta H7** — external SDRAM and updated production board files."
msgstr ""
"**Arduino Portenta H7** — externe SDRAM en bijgewerkte "
"productieboardbestanden."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:62
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "Breaking API-wijzigingen"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:64
msgid ""
"User-visible API breaks between v3.6.4 and v3.6.5. Scope: Python C-modules "
"in ``modules/``, Python libraries in ``scripts/libraries/``, and the bundled"
" tooling/examples."
msgstr ""
"Voor de gebruiker zichtbare API-breaks tussen v3.6.4 en v3.6.5. Scope: "
"Python C-modules in ``modules/``\\ , Python-bibliotheken in "
"``scripts/libraries/``\\ , en de meegeleverde tooling/voorbeelden."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:68
msgid "Each change is tagged with its impact:"
msgstr "Elke wijziging is gemarkeerd met de impact ervan:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:70
msgid "*behavior* — same API, different results; re-check tuned scripts."
msgstr ""
"*behavior* — dezelfde API, andere resultaten; controleer afgestelde scripts "
"opnieuw."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:71
msgid ""
"*tooling* — affects the build/conversion tooling or bundled examples, not "
"the firmware Python API."
msgstr ""
"*tooling* — treft de build-/conversietooling of meegeleverde voorbeelden, "
"niet de Python-API van de firmware."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:74
msgid ""
"Changes are grouped by impact in that order. If you just want to port your "
"code, jump to the :ref:`migration checklist <v3_6_5_migration>` at the end. "
"Each commit hash links to its diff on GitHub."
msgstr ""
"Wijzigingen zijn in die volgorde op impact gegroepeerd. Als je alleen je "
"code wilt porten, ga dan naar de :ref:`migratiechecklist <v3_6_5_migration>`"
" aan het eind. Elke commit-hash linkt naar de diff ervan op GitHub."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:81
msgid "OpenMV 4 Plus framebuffer reduced *(behavior)*"
msgstr "Framebuffer van OpenMV 4 Plus verkleind *(behavior)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:83
msgid ""
"The OpenMV 4 Plus framebuffer was reduced to 20 MB (and the OpenMV 2/3 "
"buffer size was corrected). Memory-tight scripts on the OpenMV 4 Plus that "
"allocated very large frames/objects from the framebuffer may now hit "
"allocation limits sooner and should be re-checked."
msgstr ""
"De framebuffer van de OpenMV 4 Plus is verkleind naar 20 MB (en de "
"buffergrootte van de OpenMV 2/3 is gecorrigeerd). Geheugenkrappe scripts op "
"de OpenMV 4 Plus die zeer grote frames/objecten uit de framebuffer "
"alloceerden, kunnen nu eerder tegen allocatielimieten aanlopen en moeten "
"opnieuw worden gecontroleerd."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:88
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `3a790a827 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/3a790a827>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commits:* `3a790a827 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/3a790a827>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:93
msgid "Legacy CMSIS-NN tooling and examples removed *(tooling)*"
msgstr "Verouderde CMSIS-NN tooling en voorbeelden verwijderd *(tooling)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:95
msgid ""
"The legacy CMSIS-NN model-training/conversion tooling (``nn_convert.py``, "
"``nn_quantizer.py``, the LeNet/CIFAR/smile model files) and the "
"``25-Machine-Learning/nn_*.py`` example scripts were removed. The ``nn`` "
"module itself still works in this release (it is removed later, in v3.9.0), "
"but the CMSIS-NN model-generation tooling is gone — use the TensorFlow Lite "
"(``tf``) workflow instead."
msgstr ""
"De verouderde CMSIS-NN model-trainings-/conversietooling (\\ "
"``nn_convert.py``\\ , ``nn_quantizer.py``\\ , de LeNet/CIFAR/smile-"
"modelbestanden) en de ``25-Machine-Learning/nn_*.py`` voorbeeldscripts zijn "
"verwijderd. De ``nn`` module zelf werkt nog in deze release (deze wordt "
"later verwijderd, in v3.9.0), maar de CMSIS-NN model-generatietooling is weg"
" — gebruik in plaats daarvan de TensorFlow Lite (\\ ``tf``\\ ) workflow."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:102
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `588f79a62 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/588f79a62>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commits:* `588f79a62 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/588f79a62>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:107
msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "Migratiechecklist"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:109
msgid ""
"Re-check large framebuffer allocations on the OpenMV 4 Plus against the "
"reduced 20 MB framebuffer (:ref:`the framebuffer change <v3_6_5_fb>`), and "
"move CMSIS-NN model generation to the TensorFlow Lite workflow (:ref:`the "
"CMSIS-NN tooling removal <v3_6_5_cmsisnn>`). All other scripts run "
"unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Controleer grote framebuffer-allocaties op de OpenMV 4 Plus opnieuw tegen de"
" verkleinde 20 MB-framebuffer (\\ :ref:`de framebuffer-wijziging "
"<v3_6_5_fb>`\\ ), en verplaats CMSIS-NN-modelgeneratie naar de TensorFlow "
"Lite-workflow (\\ :ref:`de verwijdering van CMSIS-NN-tooling "
"<v3_6_5_cmsisnn>`\\ ). Alle overige scripts draaien ongewijzigd."
